.veg/binaries.cue: builder container include list uses hof's directory layout.
veg moved lib/ and flow/ under pkg/, and script/ is gone, so the dagger
builder received a half-empty module (go.mod / missing package errors from
inception). Hand edit, not expressible by the mechanical rewrite.

Applied to copy.sh output before rewrite.sh. Idempotent via patch --forward.
--- a/.veg/binaries.cue
+++ b/.veg/binaries.cue
@@ -20,7 +20,7 @@
 				name: "veg-bin-src"
 				include: [
 					"go.mod", "go.sum", "cue.mod",
-					"cmd", "lib", "flow", "script",
+					"cmd", "pkg",
 				]
 			}},
 		]
